      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرَّقَنِى كَذَا</span></b> , (JK, S, K, *) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَأْرِيقٌ</span>. (S,
